{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-5-18","kind":"proposition","title":"分比与合比的转换","englishTitle":"If magnitudes be proportional separando, they will also be proportional componendo.","book":5,"number":18,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.18","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.18/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":18,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","contentId":"euclid-5-18","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f3b38c7adb6730c26a32a6398caa34b4129fccd8ed00912639a685dc22472489","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-5-18.statement","euclid-5-18.construction.1","euclid-5-18.proof.1","euclid-5-18.proof.2","euclid-5-18.proof.3","euclid-5-18.proof.4","euclid-5-18.proof.5","euclid-5-18.proof.6","euclid-5-18.proof.7","euclid-5-18.proof.8","euclid-5-18.proof.9","euclid-5-18.proof.10","euclid-5-18.conclusion","euclid-5-18.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-5-18.statement","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ad433550c6cc173d4f446f6c067103a3962f757e05de066cbcb9ed0aa159cd4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If magnitudes be proportional separando, they will also be proportional componendo."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果若干量在分比变换后仍成比例，那么它们在合比变换后也成比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3365016b7583c1d03c8716577072119f63bb826386fa06bddf1ceedd6bb6bc0d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let AE, EB, CF, FD be magnitudes proportional separando, so that, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD; I say that they will also be proportional componendo, that is, as AB is to BE, so is CD to FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"设量 AE、EB、CF、FD 满足分比关系，即 AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。我断言，它们也满足合比关系，即 AB 与 BE 之比等于 CD 与 FD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4b97986344ae5503b52d435594591ad159c3e47a5537cd9a383dd29502ed0ff9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if CD be not to DF as AB to BE, then, as AB is to BE, so will CD be either to some magnitude less than DF or to a greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果CD不是DF,AB到BE,那么,AB到BE,CD的幅度将小于DF,或者更大；CD 与 DF 之比不等于 AB 与 BE 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"db582429c55a79fb0f4bb0a7deac9704dfa5f8f1b4b2f09a3141e425d8c83166","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it be in that ratio to a less magnitude DG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它在比中 低于DG级。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b5ce82cc43aab65b6fa0dbac8f1ee96bbcd6c8296963c88639cacc51429c64e","citations":["euclid-5-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since, as AB is to BE, so is CD to DG, they are magnitudes proportional componendo; so that they will also be proportional separando. [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB比BE等于CD比DG, 也就是成比例比特,所以也等于成比例塞帕兰多；AB 与 BE 之比等于 CD 与 DG 之比。 [[V. 17](/principles/euclid-5-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9a5caf52b9c456b8f5d482d77635b9c466995564d998be3c94d701d9c35fbffe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as AE is to EB, so is CG to GD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AE比EB等于CG比GD；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CG 与 GD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"82a628588a80c4f50ff618123230d21029c4b9ecd480a1969cc805d3b91994fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But also, by hypothesis, as AE is to EB, so is CF to FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,假设AE比EB,则等于CF比FD；AE 与 EB 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0720817793297f5570d1f40496b1dbdd79e91794b94b68fd9991059d38916a76","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as CG is to GD, so is CF to FD. [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,CG比GD的比例也等于CF比FD；CG 与 GD 之比等于 CF 与 FD 之比。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"73a0d1fe20fd647ab50ad30abbcc1380817a6baf1a72023f7fc5f122dece65ec","citations":["euclid-5-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the first CG is greater than the third CF; therefore the second GD is also greater than the fourth FD. [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但前CG项大于第三项CF项;因此,第二项GD项也大于第四项FD项。 [[V. 14](/principles/euclid-5-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7e45d6b69d5ea21ce07c423c2a7249b0b963ea402798736d9d191c715abfd5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但情况也更少:这是不可能做到的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"087be7c872b85ecef88b03ce9f3ce0269d7bda2f6a8bdb7f439731e8754181de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as AB is to BE, so is not CD to a less magnitude than FD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,AB比BE等于CD比FD"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5f6dc38922900f988219bb72f79a2dd725f411d525369598c93b9146326da6a2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is it in that ratio to a greater; it is therefore in that ratio to FD itself."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,两者的比例都不如前者高;因此,两者的比例都与后者之比为FD。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-5-18.source","contentId":"euclid-5-18","revisionId":"euclid-5-18@raw-f3b38c7adb6730c2","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3b2fe69e1ed1b00d9fab749f2057424c9b9eeec4a1864ffcaec775080ba8e1c4","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.18/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:5.prop.18\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5